EmailTemplate.textOnly:
I am reviewing accounts for litigation and wanted to reach out to see if we can come to an agreement to resolve your account. We understand with everything going on times are difficult and we want to work together and discuss a payment plan moving forward to get the contract out of legal default.

Please let me know if you are willing to discuss a possible resolution. If we are unable to discuss we will have to move forward on the contract against both you personally in addition to the business.

Thank you,

{!User.Name}

{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}

